---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Case Study: Excel to Real-Time Dashboards"
  description="A multi-warehouse building materials distributor: 3,000+ SKUs, 800+ daily exceptions flagged, 0% variance vs SAP, 16 weeks from audit to daily use."
>
  <section class="case-hero">
    <div class="wrap case-hero-wrap">
      <span class="kicker">Case study</span>
      <h1 class="case-title">How a national building materials distributor replaced Excel with real-time operational intelligence.</h1>
      <div class="card case-snapshot">
        <div class="snap-grid">
          <div class="snap-label">Industry</div><div class="snap-value">Building materials distribution</div>
          <div class="snap-label">Operation</div><div class="snap-value">Multi-warehouse, national</div>
          <div class="snap-label">ERP</div><div class="snap-value">SAP</div>
          <div class="snap-label">SKUs</div><div class="snap-value">3,000+</div>
          <div class="snap-label">Timeline</div><div class="snap-value">16 weeks, audit to daily use</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section reveal">
    <div class="wrap case-wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">The problem</h2>
      <p class="case-para">The company ran SAP across four distribution centers. Solid for transactions. But getting data out for a decision was a different story. No real-time reporting. To see what was happening, the purchasing team exported to Excel by hand.</p>
      <div class="checkline"><span class="c">·</span><span>Hours every week pulling and reconciling spreadsheets</span></div>
      <div class="checkline"><span class="c">·</span><span>800+ items below safety stock, found by hand</span></div>
      <div class="checkline"><span class="c">·</span><span>Stockouts discovered after the customer called</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section reveal">
    <div class="wrap case-wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">The approach</h2>
      <div class="checkline"><span class="c">1</span><div><b>Paid AI audit.</b> We mapped every data flow and quantified the cost of the manual work.</div></div>
      <div class="checkline"><span class="c">2</span><div><b>Data pipeline.</b> SAP to a clean warehouse, validated against the source at 0% variance.</div></div>
      <div class="checkline"><span class="c">3</span><div><b>Dashboards and alerts.</b> One screen the purchasing team opens every morning, with exceptions flagged automatically.</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section reveal">
    <div class="wrap case-wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">The results</h2>
      <div class="card case-table">
        <div class="table-grid">
          <div class="table-header">Metric</div><div class="table-header">Before</div><div class="table-header">After</div>
          <div class="table-label">Data refresh</div><div class="table-before">Weekly Excel</div><div class="table-after">Real-time</div>
          <div class="table-label">Exceptions</div><div class="table-before">Found by hand</div><div class="table-after">800+/day, automatic</div>
          <div class="table-label">Data accuracy</div><div class="table-before">Manual errors</div><div class="table-after">0% variance vs SAP</div>
          <div class="table-label">Stockouts</div><div class="table-before">Found after the fact</div><div class="table-after">Flagged early</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section reveal text-center">
    <div class="wrap case-cta">
      <h2 class="case-cta-title">Your operation probably looks a lot like this.</h2>
      <a href="https://links.zenprocess.ai/widget/booking/rcoKJifJJA46bRI9fTEr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Book a call</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .case-hero {
    padding-top: 80px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .case-hero-wrap {
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .case-title {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 16px 0 24px;
  }
  .case-snapshot {
    padding: 8px 26px;
  }
  .snap-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
  }
  .snap-label {
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .snap-value {
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .case-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .case-wrap {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .case-para {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .case-table {
    padding: 8px 26px;
  }
  .table-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;
  }
  .table-header {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .table-label {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .table-before {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .table-after {
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--green-d);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .case-cta {
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .case-cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .btn-large {
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 16px 28px;
  }
  @media(max-width:860px) {
    .snap-grid, .table-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    }
  }
</style>
